<title>USA: Trans World Entertainment expands board.</title>
<headline>Trans World Entertainment expands board.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Entertainment Corp said on Thursday it expanded its board from five members to seven, adding Dean Adler and Joseph Morone.</p>
<p>Trans World Entertainment retails music and video products.</p>
</text>
